  "releaseNotes": "- [Sg] Heap: `linkDCE` is bucket-aware — each bucket links only against the framebuffer attachments its effect actually writes, so a non-pick-writing bucket in a pickable heap isn't forced to output `PickId` (which was synthesised as a phantom vertex input → `RO missing shader input attribute PickId`). This is the real fix for that crash; 0028's claim was premature.",
